<title>GERMANY: Jagoda sees fall in German jobless in April.</title>
<headline>Jagoda sees fall in German jobless in April.</headline>
<dateline>NUREMBERG, Germany 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>German unemployment should fall this month and continue to decline through to the middle of the year, Federal Labour Office head Bernhard Jagoda said on Tuesday after the release of jobless numbers for March.</p>
<p>Jagoda told Reuters that the labour market would follow a similar trend to a year ago -- although the absolute number out of work would be higher.</p>
</text>
